---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Privacy Policy - Story Daily Tech',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="px-6 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <header class="mb-8 md:mb-12 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tighter tracking-tighter mb-4 font-heading dark:text-gray-200">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">
        Last updated: October 15, 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="mx-auto prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <p>
        At <strong>Story Daily Tech</strong> (accessible from <a href="https://m.storydailyview.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">https://m.storydailyview.com</a>), the privacy of our visitors is one of our main priorities. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information that is collected and recorded by Story Daily Tech and how we use it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        Story Daily Tech operates as an independent technical and digital publication. We may collect non-personally identifiable information automatically via standard web server logs and analytics tools, including browser type, referring/exit pages, operating system, date/time stamps, and clickstream data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">2. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
      <p>
        Like any other website, Story Daily Tech uses 'cookies'. These cookies are used to store information including visitors' preferences, and the pages on the website that the visitor accessed or visited. The information is used to optimize the users' experience by customizing our web page content based on visitors' browser type and other details.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">3. Google AdSense & DoubleClick Cookie</h2>
      <p>
        Google is one of a third-party vendor on our site. It also uses cookies, known as DART cookies, to serve ads to our site visitors based upon their visit to Story Daily Tech and other sites on the internet. However, visitors may choose to decline the use of DART cookies by visiting the Google ad and content network Privacy Policy at the following URL: <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">4. Third-Party Content & Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We may partner with third-party analytics providers (such as Google Analytics) to help understand website traffic and usage patterns. These services may collect information sent by your browser as part of a web page request. Third-party ad servers or ad networks use technologies like cookies, JavaScript, or Web Beacons in their respective advertisements and links.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">5. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions or feedback regarding this Privacy Policy, please reach out directly via our contact email: <a href="mailto:contact@storydailyview.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">contact@storydailyview.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
